# Binary coordinates for quadratic actors on Mathieu modules

Finite tables record displacement matrices and the quadratic compatibility graphs
inside certified Sylow groups. The following modules check every table against
literal permutation actions and prove the four-element clique bound.
Source: Aschbacher--Smith H.15--16 and K.4, printed pp.458--459.
-/
